WEBVTT

00:06:58.586 --> 00:07:01.263
(Makofi)

00:07:01.287 --> 00:07:04.471
Lakini ukizingatia yale niliyofanya 
ili kufika hapa:

00:07:04.495 --> 00:07:09.786
wataalamu 25, kukusea vipimo 11,
na miaka ya maumivu na kiwewe.

00:07:10.698 --> 00:07:13.769
Nimetumia muda mwingi kuwaza
kama kuna njia nzuri zaidi,

00:07:13.793 --> 00:07:17.845
Na ninadhani ipo:
teknolojia ya kusaidia-usonji.

00:07:18.503 --> 00:07:20.520
Teknolojia hii
itafanya kazi muhimu

00:07:20.544 --> 00:07:23.399
katika kuwasaidia watu 
wenye tatizo la usonji,

00:07:23.423 --> 00:07:24.577
au ASD.

00:07:26.465 --> 00:07:31.431
podium ya programu, iliyoachiliwa
na kampuni yangu, AutismSees,